{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>近年復古文化再度興起，不少經典產品以新面貌回歸市場。7-Eleven香港及澳門今年聯同Sanrio characters推出《RE-PLAY經典回憶》系列，將九十年代盛行的掌上電子遊戲機重新演繹，勾起不少人的童年回憶。系列集合7位Sanrio人氣角色包括Hello Kitty、My Melody、Kuromi、Cinnamoroll、Pompompurin、Hangyodon，每款均配備專屬小遊戲及黑白螢幕設計，而Pochacco則以隱藏版身份登場。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2013156/block/singleImage/3271534/df/01M7QKAVCEJQE478GVVQNHCTD1.jpg?updatedAt=1795014809\"/><figcaption>Sanrio人氣角色萌爆登場，結合角色特徵打造主題小遊戲。</figcaption></figure><p>此外，7-Eleven同步推出以磁碟(Floppy Disk)為設計靈感的小物系列，將復古科技元素融入日常用品之中。《RE-PLAY經典回憶》系列即日起登場，為Sanrio粉絲及懷舊遊戲迷帶來別具特色的收藏選擇。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T21:31:45.921949+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":364,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:41.256446+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T21:24:58.605715+00:00","content_hash":"4eb11af71e98487cb867921277ca99e98071bdbb904556b93c6d5d848323ba63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T21:31:45.921949+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}